,deleteDuring:`Delete during transfer`,deleteAfter:`Delete after transfer`,deleteExcluded:`Delete excluded files from the destination`,deleteExcludedHint:`Sync also deletes destination files normally protected by the filter rules.`,oneFileSystem:`Stay within one file system`,noUpdateModtime:`Keep modification times when contents match`,modifyWindow:`Modification time tolerance`,modifyWindowHint:`Leave blank for rclone to use both ends’ time precision. Set a value such as 1s only when needed. Differences smaller than this tolerance count as equal; too large a value can miss closely timed changes.`,ignoreChecksum:`Skip post-transfer checksum verification`,ignoreChecksumHint:`Only affects verification after transfer, not content comparison before transfer.`,checkFirst:`Finish checking before transferring`,noTraverse:`Skip listing the destination (copy and move)`,fastList:`Use fast recursive listing (more memory)`,minSize:`Minimum file size`,maxSize:`Maximum file size`,fileSizeHint:`Leave blank for no limit; for example 100k or 2M.`,minAge:`Minimum file age`,maxAge:`Maximum file age`,ageHint:`Time since modification, such as 1h or 7d. Blank means no limit.`,maxDepth:`Maximum folder depth`,maxDepthHint:`-1 means unlimited depth.`,connectTimeout:`Connection timeout`,ioTimeout:`Idle transfer timeout`,durationHint:`For example 30s, 1m, or 5m.`,lowLevelRetries:`Low-level retry attempts`,retrySleep:`Delay between retries`,extraArgs:`Additional rclone arguments`,extraArgsHint:`One --flag or --flag=value per line, without quotes. Supported transfer arguments only.`,syncOnly:`Sync only`,comparisonSummary:`Compare`,resizeColumn:`Resize column`,resizeColumnHint:`Drag to resize; arrow keys to adjust; double-click to reset.`,resetColumns:`Reset column widths`,accountRequired:`Add a cloud or NAS account`,openAccountSetup:`Open account setup`,accountsHint:`Use Account setup to add cloud or NAS accounts, then choose them in either pane.`,confirmingSettings:`Applying location settings…`